# Build-context exclusions for novel-weaver image（有 Dockerfile 后再启用）
# Builder 通常只需要：pyproject.toml / package.json、README、src/
# 排除其余内容以缩小 context，并避免无关编辑打穿依赖缓存层。

# ── VCS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github

# ── Python build / cache ─────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.so
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
wheels/
.Python

# ── Virtual environments ─────────────────────────────────────
.venv
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ── Test / tooling caches ────────────────────────────────────
tests/
conftest.py
benchmarks/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytools/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.tox/
.nox/

# ── Secrets and local config ─────────────────────────────────
# .env 永不进镜像层；运行时用 env_file / -e 注入
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# ── Generation artifacts / workspaces ────────────────────────
output/
artifacts/
runs/
checkpoints/
cache/
workspace/
workspaces/
stories/
canon/
drafts/
candidates/
chroma/
.vector_store/
vector_store/
embeddings/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.faiss
*.log

# ── Local-only design docs ───────────────────────────────────
PROJECT_POSITIONING.md
docs-nocommit/
CLAUDE.md

# ── Documentation / site ─────────────────────────────────────
docs/
docs-nocommit/
site/
CHANGELOG.md
README.zh-CN.md
SECURITY.md

# ── Container files themselves ───────────────────────────────
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.*.yml

# ── Editor / OS ──────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── AI tooling ───────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/
.mimocode/
superpowers/
.workbuddy/
